 Carmen and have a few things I&#039;m trying to get rid of.  Please feel free to ask any questions.  Shipping is additional.  Will combine shipping on multiple items.  Thanks for looking and best of luck on your planning!\n\n\n22 raffia fans-- variety of small, medium and large size. $10 \n\n\n\n\nSenor\/Senora Signs. We used these at our sweetheart table (we set them on easels) and also in our photographs. They have rope attached so they could be hung as well.  $30 \n\n\n\nRhinestone &#039;M&#039; cake topper purchased on Etsy.  $25 \n\n\n\n11 Seashell holders.  Used these to hold table numbers and menus.  $20 \n\n\n7 maracas. Authentic, purchased in Playa del Carmen.  2 blue, 2 orange, 2 pink, 1 green.  $10 \n\n\n8 galvanized vases.  Used these to hold bouquets on tables.  $15 \n\n\nBeach theme wedding cake topper.  Never used.  $15 \n\n\n1 pair of J.Crew starfish earring. Brand new.  $10 \n\n\n1 starfish, $2\n\n\n25 cake boxes $5\n\n\n\nI also have a white cathedral length veil if anyone is interested please let me know and I can send pictures. It is brand new, never used. \n\n\nI will throw the following in for free if someone needs them:  20 spanish to go guides and a baggie of tiny shells","Attachments":[{"Id":35390,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-276111-0-47736400-1459184232.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-276111-0-47736400-1459184232_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":747},{"Id":35391,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-276111-0-06235300-1459184261.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-276111-0-06235300-1459184261_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":747},{"Id":35392,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2016\/post-276111-0-44631500-1459184320.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\