 used as these were extras). We attached a poem and a bag of rose petals to them, but will cut off prior to shipping. Fans are assorted sizes.-- $20\n\n\n*12\" white square cake stand-- $8\n\n\n*100 opaque turquoise chair sashes (new, never used)-- $45\n\n\nAll items don&#039;t include shipping. If you send me your zip code I can calculate that cost for you. I&#039;m in Chicago :)\n\n","Attachments":[],"Id":1913129,"PostDate":1461719013,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Post-wedding sale:<br><br>\n*32 raffia fans wrapped in coral ribbon (never used as these were extras). We attached a poem and a bag of rose petals to them, but will cut off prior to shipping. Fans are assorted sizes.-- $20<br><br>\n*12\" white square cake stand-- $8<br><br>\n*100 opaque turquoise chair sashes (new, never used)-- $45<br><br>\nAll items don't include shipping. If you send me your zip code I can calculate that cost for you. I'm in Chicago <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1913129]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2016\/post-266061-0-94780700-1461715283.jpg\" title=\"20160426_182301.jpg - Size: 97.72KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2016\/post-266061-0-94780700-1461715283.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"20160426_182301.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1913129]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.s