                }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281952\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281952-racht33\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">racht33<\/span><\/a> have you looked on Etsy? Some of the sellers may have the color you're looking for \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"townsendsmithwed@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.66.3.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427024404,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1444096181","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tiffanyt","Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.26.160.183","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80064,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a459f6fa871c4679f797851949f8a194","RawContent":"@[member=\"racht33\"] I ordered sunglasses from Ebay. They came from China, so they took a while, but we had plenty of time when we ordered them so it wasn&#039;t an issue. They were reasonably priced too!","Attachments":[],"Id":1913179,"PostDate":1461884402,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281952\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281952-racht33\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">racht33<\/span><\/a> I ordered sunglasses from Ebay. They came from China, so they took a while, but we had plenty of time when we ordered them so it wasn't an issue. They were reasonably priced too!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10743;484\/st\/20160413\/e\/Wedding+Day\/k\/c760\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n","Email":"lm_sprowl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"75.26.164.62","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418257431,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"cruisebride2016","Id":281378,"Name":"cruisebride2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.13.219","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80064,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9da6bf989d72cee0b45a882511094d56","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@racht33&amp;nbsp; Hi. I&#039;m not sure that you&#039;ll be able to get an exact match on your colour, but there are definitely several different sites you can look at that will give you some options, especially being in the US. The brides here that are in canada have a much more difficult time with bulk sites, and ordering from the US with shipping to canada can get very expensive! Having said that, here&#039;s a couple of sites that I found that I know other brides here have used.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.discountmugs.com\/category\/sunglasses-and-accessories\/&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.discountmugs.com\/category\/sunglasses-and-accessories\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.logolenses.com\/shop\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.logolenses.com\/shop\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913227,"PostDate":1462114959,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@racht33\u00a0 Hi. I'm not sure that you'll be able to get an exact match on your colour, but there are definitely several different sites you can look at that will give you some options, especially being in the US. The brides here that are in canada have a much more difficult time with bulk sites, and ordering from the US with shipping to canada can get very expensive! Having said that, here's a couple of sites that I found that I know other brides here have used.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.discountmugs.com\/category\/sunglasses-and-accessories\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.discount...nd-accessories\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.logolenses.com\/shop\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.logolenses.com\/shop\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80064","Title":"Sunglasses","LastPostDate":1462114959},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
