r our guest welcome bags for our Playa del Carmen Wedding? Also, what are the items that were the biggest hit, regret putting in the welcome bags\/waste of money, wish you would have put in the bags and\/or that were the most used?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Lastly, what websites have the best quality and best prices for bulk customized sunglasses and beach tote bags for the bridesmaids?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am sorry for so many questions... I feel I waste a ton of time trying to research and find these websites and we are less than 30 days out.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you so much! I truly appreciate it!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911619,"PostDate":1457272905,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi! Does anyone know of any amazing websites\/places with cheap prices to get bulk travel size items for our guest welcome bags for our Playa del Carmen Wedding? Also, what are the items that were the biggest hit, regret putting in the welcome bags\/waste of money, wish you would have put in the bags and\/or that were the most used?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Lastly, what websites have the best quality and best prices for bulk customized sunglasses and beach tote bags for the bridesmaids?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am sorry for so many questions... I feel I waste a ton of time trying to research and find these websites and we are less than 30 days out.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you so much! I truly appreciate it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleyotto86@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"162.236.154.70","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428539400,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282682.jpg?_r=1428639853","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":264,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Ao1070","Id":282682,"Name":"Ao1070","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.184.57","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79979,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf406ca7f1df08e01c6d47aac418342b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s a link that&#039;s helpful: &amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/29980-my-oot-bags-the-big-hits-and-the-things-that-werent-used\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/29980-my-oot-bags-the-big-hits-and-the-things-that-werent-used\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;From what I remember from reading the thread that were hits:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Kwik tek Dry packs&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hangover meds: (Advil, Emergen-C, Tylenol, PeptoBismol)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Pashminas&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Misses:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Door hangers&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;That&#039;s all I remember. &amp;nbsp;In that thread, there are links to websites that have bulk travel size items but I didn&#039;t take note since I&#039;m Canadian.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911694,"PostDate":1457541678,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Here's a link that's helpful: \u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/29980-my-oot-bags-the-big-hits-and-the-things-that-werent-used\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...at-werent-used\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>From what I remember from reading the thread that were hits:<\/p>\n<p>Kwik tek Dry packs<\/p>\n<p>Hangover meds: (Advil, Emergen-C, Tylenol, PeptoBismol)<\/p>\n<p>Pashminas<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Misses:<\/p>\n<p>Door hangers<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That's all I remember. \u00a0In that thread, there are links to websites that have bulk travel size items but I didn't take note since I'm Canadian.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falleneight@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.26.14.237","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441713031,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284728.jpg?_r=1448387511","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"OttawaBride2017","Id":284728,"Name":"OttawaBride2017","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.86.230","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79979,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"147aea6e9e4de2b39ec66a53f48c3cdd","RawContent":"For the tote bags try cheaptotes.com \n\nFor the sunglasses I saw them reasonably priced on orientaltrading.com\n\n\nGood luck","Attachments":[],"Id":1911703,"PostDate":1457560990,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                For the tote bags try cheaptotes.com <br>\nFor the sunglasses I saw them reasonably priced on orientaltrading.com<br><br>\nGood luck \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jasminr3803@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.143.196.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1452598467,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285860.jpeg?_r=1457570331","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jasminr3803","Id":285860,"Name":"Jasminr3803","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.76.121.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79979,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fcc6a97ed0b5e4e08ea672b8d7fc1d0b","RawContent":"Thank you!","Attachments":[],"Id":1911706,"PostDate":1457564280,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleyotto86@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"162.236.154.70","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428539400,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282682.jpg?_r=1428639853","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":264,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Ao1070","Id":282682,"Name":"Ao1070","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.222.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79979,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7aedb8b859cea71ce2cecdb943b9eb37","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am the Sales Manager for AllTravelSizes.com.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We feature over 1200 travel size products. You can use coupon code:&amp;nbsp;WEDDING2016 for 10% off any purchase on our website!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We also feature free shipping on all orders over $40 shipped in the US.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-Justin&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913023,"PostDate":1461243971,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am the Sales Manager for AllTravelSizes.com.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We feature over 1200 travel size products. You can use coupon code:\u00a0WEDDING2016 for 10% off any purchase on our website!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We also feature free shipping on all orders over $40 shipped in the US.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>-Justin<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"justin@weinersltd.com","IpAddress":"216.165.183.54","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427289470,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"justinl","Id":282537,"Name":"justinl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.99.50.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79979,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"411e1e253ab3888143a704ac09916947","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Ao1070\"] I&#039;m planning on putting in:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Tote bags&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Hangover meds: (Advil, Emergen-C, Tylenol, PeptoBismol)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Water bottles (for excursions, or double up on drinks)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;luggage tags&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;inflatable pool toys&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;decks of cards&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;sunglasses&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&