lbums - about $5 and the Pashminas $4. I was originally only going to give the photo albums, but I kept finding more ideas. <br \/> <br \/> Thanks again for all the positive comments!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"heidemoeller@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1233715241,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214606.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"uconncruiser","Id":214606,"Name":"uconncruiser","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":75,"TotalPages":8,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":70},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}